WEBVTT

00:00:01.696 --> 00:00:05.200
Lucky Hermione pays attention
in herbology.

00:00:06.827 --> 00:00:08.328
Hermione: What is that?

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:12.207
I don't know. Sounds like wings.

00:00:25.387 --> 00:00:28.849
Hermione: Curious.
I've never seen birds like these.

00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:32.686
Harry: They're not birds.
They're keys.

00:00:32.894 --> 00:00:36.356
And I'll bet one of them
fits that door.

00:00:39.776 --> 00:00:44.447
- What's this all about?
- I don't know.

00:00:50.287 --> 00:00:52.372
Strange.

00:00:52.789 --> 00:00:55.083
Ron: Alohomora!

00:00:58.044 --> 00:01:00.297
Well, it was worth a try.

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:03.758
What will we do?
There must be a thousand keys.

00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:07.888
Ron: We want a big, old-fashioned one.
Probably rusty.

00:01:08.096 --> 00:01:11.516
I see it!
The one with the broken wing.

00:01:15.103 --> 00:01:17.439
What's wrong?

00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:19.816
It's too simple.

00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:24.779
Go on! If Snape could catch it
on that old broomstick, you can.

00:01:24.988 --> 00:01:28.533
You're the youngest seeker
in a century.

00:01:45.342 --> 00:01:48.345
This complicates things a bit.

00:02:09.658 --> 00:02:11.576
Harry: Catch the key!

00:02:15.997 --> 00:02:17.874
Hurry up!

00:02:50.407 --> 00:02:55.078
Hermione: I don't like this.
I don't like this at all.

